          <a href="/tiktok-bio-checker" class="p-5 bg-surface-card hover:bg-surface-strong rounded-xl border border-hairline transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between space-y-3">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">TikTok Bio Checker & Counter</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Test character limits and formatting constraints against TikTok&rsquo;s strict 80-character profile bio cutoff.</p>
