              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Instagram Engagement Calculator</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Calculate reach-based (ERR) and follower-based (ERF) engagement rates with realistic benchmark comparisons.</p>
