          <a href="/roi-calculator" class="p-5 bg-surface-card hover:bg-surface-strong rounded-xl border border-hairline transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between space-y-3">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">ROI & CAGR Calculator</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Evaluate Return on Investment, annualized compound growth rates, and marketing campaign payback periods.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1">Calculate ROI &rarr;</span>
